{"id":"9327c800e7f50ea0","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-prop-additivity-null.md","title":"Additivity of Null","display":"prop-additivity-null — Additivity of Null","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-additivity-null","aliases":["58-prop-additivity-null"],"display":"prop-additivity-null — Additivity of Null","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-measure11-completion-null-ideal]]","[[58-df-zfc-ci-covering-null-number]]","[[58-df-additivity]]","[[58-df-continuum]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-additivity-null"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-additivity-null</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-additivity-null — Additivity of Null"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"13058b978a5631a8\" href=\"?note=13058b978a5631a8\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure11-completion-null-ideal\">58-df-zfc-measure11-completion-null-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9dcb3365c965859\" href=\"?note=f9dcb3365c965859\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ci-covering-null-number\">58-df-zfc-ci-covering-null-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a88cbf5f6d98949d\" href=\"?note=a88cbf5f6d98949d\" title=\"58-df-additivity\">58-df-additivity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"58-df-continuum\">58-df-continuum</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\mathcal N,\\kappa_{\\mathrm{add}},\\kappa_{\\mathrm{cov}}\\in V\">\\(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\mathcal N,\\kappa_{\\mathrm{add}},\\kappa_{\\mathrm{cov}}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11CompletionNullIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11CompletionNullIdeal}_S\\)</span> (completed null-ideal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Additivity}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Additivity}_S\\)</span> (ideal-additivity predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiCoveringNullNumber}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiCoveringNullNumber}_S\\)</span> (null-covering-number predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c\">\\(\\mathfrak c\\)</span> (continuum cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"58-df-continuum\">58-df-continuum</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}additivity-null} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11CompletionNullIdeal}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\mathcal N)\\land X=\\mathbb R\\land0&lt;\\mu(X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\{x\\}\\in\\mathcal N)\\land\\mathrm{Additivity}_S(\\mathcal N,X,\\kappa_{\\mathrm{add}})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCiCoveringNullNumber}_S(\\kappa_{\\mathrm{cov}},\\mathcal N)\\to\\omega_1\\leq\\kappa_{\\mathrm{add}}\\leq\\kappa_{\\mathrm{cov}}\\leq\\mathfrak c\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}additivity-null} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11CompletionNullIdeal}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\mathcal N)\\land X=\\mathbb R\\land0&lt;\\mu(X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\{x\\}\\in\\mathcal N)\\land\\mathrm{Additivity}_S(\\mathcal N,X,\\kappa_{\\mathrm{add}})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCiCoveringNullNumber}_S(\\kappa_{\\mathrm{cov}},\\mathcal N)\\to\\omega_1\\leq\\kappa_{\\mathrm{add}}\\leq\\kappa_{\\mathrm{cov}}\\leq\\mathfrak c\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two cardinal values and the completed null ideal are explicit parameters tied to their defining predicates.</li>\n<li>ZFC proves the displayed inequalities.</li>\n<li>The exact values of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{add}(\\mathcal N)\">\\(\\mathrm{add}(\\mathcal N)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cov}(\\mathcal N)\">\\(\\mathrm{cov}(\\mathcal N)\\)</span> are not fixed by ZFC.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure11-completion-null-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"13058b978a5631a8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure11-completion-null-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-ci-covering-null-number","status":"resolved","id":"f9dcb3365c965859","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-ci-covering-null-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-additivity","status":"resolved","id":"a88cbf5f6d98949d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-additivity]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuum","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-continuum]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuum","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak c$ (continuum cardinal, see [[58-df-continuum]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\mathcal N,\\kappa_{\\mathrm{add}},\\kappa_{\\mathrm{cov}}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11CompletionNullIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Additivity}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiCoveringNullNumber}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}additivity-null} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11CompletionNullIdeal}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\mathcal N)\\land X=\\mathbb R\\land0<\\mu(X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\{x\\}\\in\\mathcal N)\\land\\mathrm{Additivity}_S(\\mathcal N,X,\\kappa_{\\mathrm{add}})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCiCoveringNullNumber}_S(\\kappa_{\\mathrm{cov}},\\mathcal N)\\to\\omega_1\\leq\\kappa_{\\mathrm{add}}\\leq\\kappa_{\\mathrm{cov}}\\leq\\mathfrak c","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{add}(\\mathcal N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cov}(\\mathcal N)","display":false}],"bytes":1454,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3930","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-prop-additivity-null.md|58-prop-additivity-null]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["13058b978a5631a8","f9dcb3365c965859","a88cbf5f6d98949d","99c5552e170feee3"]}